---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { contact } from '../../data/navigation';

// [CONFIRM] legal review before launch (CONTENT-TODO.md).
---

<Layout socialImage="privacy" title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the Aetas Security privacy policy for www.aetassecurity.com.">
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-6 sm:py-24">
    <Breadcrumbs class="mb-6" items={[{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy Policy', href: '/legal/privacy' }]} />
    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-gray-300">
      <p>Last updated: October 23, 2026</p>
      <p>Aetas Security ("we", "us", or "our"), the cybersecurity practice of Aetas Global Innovation, operates www.aetassecurity.com. This policy explains what information we collect through this website and how we use it.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mt-8">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you use the contact form, we receive your name, work email address, company, the service you select, and the message you write. When you email or call us, we receive the information you choose to share. If you book a demo, the booking service collects the details you enter.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mt-8">2. How We Use Information</h2>
      <p>We use the information you share to respond to your inquiry and to discuss Aetas Security services with you. Contact form submissions are delivered to our team by email through an email delivery provider.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mt-8">3. Cookies and Analytics</h2>
      <p>The contact form sets one short-lived, strictly necessary security cookie that protects form submissions from forgery. This website does not use advertising or analytics cookies.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mt-8">4. Information Protection</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards designed to protect the information you share with us.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-display font-bold text-white mt-8">5. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this policy can be sent to <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`} class="font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent-text)] underline-offset-4 hover:underline">{contact.email}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
